Upstream project
  MAgPIE — Model of Agricultural Production and its Impact on the Environment
  Potsdam Institute for Climate Impact Research (PIK)
  https://github.com/magpiemodel/magpie
  License: AGPL-3.0-or-later with the MAgPIE License Exception.
  This branch (iiasa-4.11.0) is based on upstream tag v4.11.0. PIK's LICENSE
  and CITATION.cff are inherited unchanged.

What this overlay adds
  The MAgPIE -> MESSAGEix land-use emulator pipeline: experiment declaration
  and one command that runs the four phases (calibrate, price, demand, reduce),
  the packing of inputs between them, matrix generation including woodfuel
  post-processing, and pipeline documentation. Everything lives under
  messageix/; no path outside that folder differs from upstream v4.11.0.

Authorship
  Scientific authorship of the pipeline: Di Sheng (IIASA). The emulator code
  was developed in https://github.com/dsheng1026/MAgPIE_emulator and is merged
  here with its commit history preserved. The woodfuel extraction builds on
  code by Kristine Karstens (PIK). Repository packaging and consolidation:
  Setu Pelz (IIASA ECE).
